@startuml deck-modules
' Technical packages inside Deck. kafka <-> service is a cycle, so this
' file is a picture only — do not pass it to ArchUnit.

title Deck packages (documentation)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

[controller] as ctrl
[service / pipeline] as svc
[adapters] as ad
[kafka] as kaf

ctrl --> svc
ctrl --> ad
svc --> ad
svc --> kaf
kaf --> svc

note bottom of kaf
  Consumers call DeckService; DeckService publishes
  deck.built. That cycle is real. Not an ArchUnit input.
end note

@enduml
